$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: tert-Butyl
2-(((Z)-(2-(((2S,3S)-1-((((S)-4-(2-(4,5-bis(benzyloxy)picolinamido)acetamido)-2-oxopyrrolidin-1-yl)sulfonyl)carbamoyl)-2-methyl-4-oxoazetidin-3-yl)amino)-1-(2-((tert-butoxycarbonyl)amino)thiazol-4-yl)-2-oxoethylidene)amino)oxy)-2-methylpropanoate
(INT-C): HATU (0.13 g, 0.33 mmol) and DIPEA (0.067 mL, 0.38 mmol) were
added to a solution of 2-(4,5-bis(benzyloxy)picolinamido)acetic acid (0.1
g, 0.25 mmol) in DMF (2 mL). The mixture was stirred at room temperature
for 10min. tert-Butyl
2-(((Z)-(2-(((2S,3S)-1-((((S)-4-amino-2-oxopyrrolidin-1-yl)sulfonyl)carbamoyl)-2-methyl-4-oxoazetidin-3-yl)amino)-1-(2-((tert-butoxycarbonyl)amino)thiazol-4-yl)-2-oxoethylidene)amino)oxy)-2-methylpropanoate
(7) (0.16 g, 0.23 mmol) was added. The reaction mixture was stirred at
room temperature for 1h. EtOAc and water were added. The layers were
separated. The aqueous layer was extracted with EtOAc (2x). The combined
organic layers were washed with brine, dried with Na2SO4, concentrated,
and purified by silica gel column chromatography (0-5% MeOH in DCM).
tert-Butyl
2-(((Z)-(2-(((2S,3S)-1-((((S)-4-((S)-2-(4,5-bis(benzyloxy)picolinamido)-3-((tert-butoxycarbonyl)amino)propanamido)-2-oxopyrrolidin-1-yl)sulfonyl)carbamoyl)-2-methyl-4-oxoazetidin-3-yl)amino)-1-(2-((tert-butoxycarbonyl)amino)thiazol-4-yl)-2-oxoethylidene)amino)oxy)-2-methylpropanoate:
The title compound was synthesized similarly to INT-C using 7 and
(S)-2-(4,5-bis(benzyloxy)picolinamido)-3-((tert-butoxycarbonyl)amino)propanoic
acid (235 mg, 0.45 mmol). The reaction mixture was diluted with EtOAc,
washed with brine, concentrated, and purified by silica gel column
chromatography (0-100% EtOAc in hexanes). The product as a solid (398 mg,
72%). ESI-MS m/z: 1220.5 [M + H]+.
